			description: [
				"Mana that set while it was still burning."
				""
				"Found in geodes, never alone — every geode is the seam between two alignments."
				""
				"BUDDING EMBERGLASS grows fresh clusters over time, so a geode is a renewable deposit rather than a finite one. It drops nothing without Silk Touch, so you cannot move it."
