		{
			description: [
				"Emberglass on one side, Duskglass on the other, with a visible seam between them."
				""
				"FREQUENCY: about 1 in 15 eligible chunks. Vanilla amethyst is 1 in 24, for comparison."
				"BIOMES: sundered highlands, ashen grove, scorchfell."
				""
				"These sit 14 to 28 blocks below the surface you are standing on, not at a fixed depth."
				""
				"LOOK FOR THE SMALL ONES. A miniature geode on the surface means a full geode is directly below it, within about 32 blocks. Surface geodes never appear without one — if you see the crystals, dig."
			]
